  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Research Collaboration Efforts Between USDAARS and International Scientists Working on Priority Research Projects of Mutual Interest</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Inter-American Institute for Cooperation on Agriculture (IICA) will direct technical cooperation through actions aimed at four strategic objectives: To increase the contributions of the agriculture sector to economic growth and sustainable development; to contribute to the well-being of all rural dwellers; to improve international and regional trade for countries in the region; to increase the resilience of rural areas and agri-food systems to extreme events.</narrative>
